     A                                  1 17'CORPORATE CODE ALTERNATE KEY MENU'
     A                                  3  1'This program allows you to add or'
     A                                  3 35'delete alternate keys for corporat-
     A                                      e codes.'
     A                                  4  1'For example, you may wish the name'
     A                                  4 36'ADAMAX to stand for corporate code'
     A                                  5  1'2601011.'
     A                                  7  1'The alternate key can be used in t-
     A                                      he Material Status Inquiry (Q1) to'
     A                                  7 70'bring up'
     A                                  8  1'the actual corporate code data.'
     A                                 10  1'Note: for raw materials, the alter-
     A                                      nate keys are maintained automatica-
     A                                      lly by'
     A                                 11  1'the Akron Update program.'
     A                                 13  1'Choose one of the following functi-
     A                                      ons:'
     A                                 15 17'f1   TO ADD ALTERNATE KEY'
     A                                 17 17'f2   TO DELETE ALTERNATE KEY'
     A                                 19 17'f8   FOR MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('f1-ADD ALT KEY f2-DELETE AL-
     A                                      T KEY f8-MATERIAL STATUS f3-END PRO-
     A                                      GRAM             ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
     A  99        MESSAGELN1    79   M
     A  99                                  OVRDTA
